      "content": "liberating? i dont see how. it just feels like i'm stuck in a loop of pointless effort. if everything is truly indifferent and there's zero objective value to existence, then every second spent trying to \"find freedom\" or \"overcome the burden\" is just more energy wasted on the glitch. if the universe doesn't care, why should we care about maintaining the error?",
